# Kept byte for byte: each nc-received.txt holds the HTTP/1.1 bytes nc received on the held
# connection, CRLF line ends included, which responses.py parses; tracker-search.txt holds one
# GitHub issue-body line that carries its own CRLF. Without this, a checkout with
# core.autocrlf=input would rewrite them on commit and counts.py would not reproduce counts.csv.
nc-received.txt -text
tracker-search.txt -text
